  "__class__": "Meeting",
  "transcript": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": "00:11:53.280",
      "end": "00:13:16.130",
      "text": "made before or during."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": "00:13:16.130",
      "end": "00:13:17.170",
      "text": "Good afternoon, everyone."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": "00:13:17.170",
      "end": "00:13:18.270",
      "text": "This is a special meeting"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": "00:13:18.270",
      "end": "00:13:20.120",
      "text": "in the Community and Protective Services Committee."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": "00:13:20.120",
      "end": "00:13:22.450",
      "text": "It's our 11th meeting."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": "00:13:22.450",
      "end": "00:13:24.660",
      "text": "The city of London is situated on the traditional lands"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": "00:13:24.660",
      "end": "00:13:29.120",
      "text": "of the Nishnajbak, Potashone, Linamak, and Adwondron."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": "00:13:29.120",
      "end": "00:13:30.490",
      "text": "We honor and respect the history,"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": "00:13:30.490",
      "end": "00:13:31.360",
      "text": "and languages, and culture,"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": "00:13:31.360",
      "end": "00:13:34.490",
      "text": "the diverse indigenous people who call this territory home."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": "00:13:34.490",
      "end": "00:13:35.850",
      "text": "The city of London is currently home"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": "00:13:35.850",
      "end": "00:13:39.010",
      "text": "to many First Nation, M\u00e9tis, and Inuit today."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": "00:13:39.010",
      "end": "00:13:41.550",
      "text": "As representatives of the people of the city of London,"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": "00:13:41.550",
      "end": "00:13:43.690",
      "text": "we are grateful to have the opportunity"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": "00:13:43.690",
      "end": "00:13:48.630",
      "text": "to work and live in this territory."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": "00:13:48.630",
      "end": "00:13:51.690",
      "text": "I will ask, I believe we have Councillor Stevenson"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": "00:13:51.690",
      "end": "00:13:53.630",
      "text": "and Councillor Raman joining us virtually."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": "00:13:53.630",
      "end": "00:13:56.560",
      "text": "I will ask you to put on your screens for a moment"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": "00:13:56.560",
      "end": "00:14:07.190",
      "text": "just to verify that you are here with us for quorum."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": "00:14:07.190",
      "end": "00:14:10.380",
      "text": "Big thank you for your information."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": "00:14:10.380",
      "end": "00:14:11.800",
      "text": "I have Councillor Ferreira"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": "00:14:11.800",
      "end": "00:14:14.170",
      "text": "and Councillor Pripple joining me in chambers today."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": "00:14:14.170",
      "end": "00:14:18.110",
      "text": "So we do have quorum and we are verified."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": "00:14:18.110",
      "end": "00:14:20.160",
      "text": "The city of London is committed to making every effort"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": "00:14:20.160",
      "end": "00:14:22.440",
      "text": "to provide alternate formats and communication supports"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": "00:14:22.440",
      "end": "00:14:24.090",
      "text": "for meetings upon request."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": "00:14:24.090",
      "end": "00:14:25.690",
      "text": "To make a request specific to this meeting,"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": "00:14:25.690",
      "end": "00:14:30.820",
      "text": "please contact CPSC at London.ca or 519-661-2489,"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": "00:14:30.820",
      "end": "00:14:35.620",
      "text": "extension 2425."
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": "00:14:35.620",
      "end": "00:14:37.000",
      "text": "I'm looking into committee for disclosures"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": "00:14:37.000",
      "end": "00:14:43.920",
      "text": "of pecuniary interest, seeing none."
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": "00:14:43.920",
      "end": "00:14:46.330",
      "text": "We have no consent items, no scheduled items."
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": "00:14:46.330",
      "end": "00:14:48.420",
      "text": "We have one item under items for direction,"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": "00:14:48.420",
      "end": "00:14:52.100",
      "text": "being 4.1, Building Safer Community Funds,"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": "00:14:52.100",
      "end": "00:14:54.350",
      "text": "Multi-Year Contribution Agreement."
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": "00:14:54.350",
      "end": "00:14:56.910",
      "text": "I'm gonna go to staff first for a brief overview"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": "00:14:56.910",
      "end": "00:14:59.120",
      "text": "recognizing it's a special meeting"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": "00:14:59.120",
      "end": "00:15:07.890",
      "text": "and an exciting report before us, Ms. Smith."
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": "00:15:07.890",
      "end": "00:15:09.250",
      "text": "Thank you and through the chair,"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": "00:15:09.250",
      "end": "00:15:11.270",
      "text": "before you today is our second report,"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": "00:15:11.270",
      "end": "00:15:14.020",
      "text": "seeking council's approval to enter into agreement"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": "00:15:14.020",
      "end": "00:15:16.640",
      "text": "with the federal government in order to flow"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": "00:15:16.640",
      "end": "00:15:18.310",
      "text": "the second allotment of funding,"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": "00:15:18.310",
      "end": "00:15:21.690",
      "text": "which is approximately $3 million to London."
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": "00:15:21.690",
      "end": "00:15:25.720",
      "text": "This is part of the federal's Building Safer Communities Funds."
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": "00:15:25.720",
      "end": "00:15:28.050",
      "text": "The report also provides you an overview"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": "00:15:28.050",
      "end": "00:15:30.880",
      "text": "of the needs assessment and engagement undertaken"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": "00:15:30.880",
      "end": "00:15:33.490",
      "text": "with community organizations and young people"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": "00:15:33.490",
      "end": "00:15:36.340",
      "text": "and an overview of the proposed multi-year strategy"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": "00:15:36.340",
      "end": "00:15:40.940",
      "text": "and plan that was developed based on this engagement."
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": "00:15:40.940",
      "end": "00:15:44.150",
      "text": "Thank you for allowing us to hold this special meeting today"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": "00:15:44.150",
      "end": "00:15:46.950",
      "text": "as our current agreement with the federal government"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": "00:15:46.950",
      "end": "00:15:49.920",
      "text": "expires on June 30th, 2023."
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": "00:15:49.920",
      "end": "00:15:52.800",
      "text": "So in order to receive the next installment of funding,"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": "00:15:52.800",
      "end": "00:15:56.200",
      "text": "the government requires we enter into a signed agreement"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": "00:15:56.200",
      "end": "00:16:00.230",
      "text": "and submitted to the government by June 30th, 2023."
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": "00:16:00.230",
      "end": "00:16:02.440",
      "text": "Hence the urgency of this matter."
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": "00:16:02.440",
      "end": "00:16:04.820",
      "text": "I have staff here if you have any further questions"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": "00:16:04.820",
      "end": "00:16:07.510",
      "text": "on the report itself, thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": "00:16:07.510",
      "end": "00:16:09.520",
      "text": "Thank you and as already stated,"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": "00:16:09.520",
      "end": "00:16:11.560",
      "text": "thank you for committee making this meeting possible,"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": "00:16:11.560",
      "end": "00:16:14.790",
      "text": "realizing we will deal with this item today"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": "00:16:14.790",
      "end": "00:16:17.280",
      "text": "and it will go to council on the 27th"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": "00:16:17.280",
      "end": "00:16:19.490",
      "text": "for our final approval in advance"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": "00:16:19.490",
      "end": "00:16:22.950",
      "text": "of the federal government's deadline to receive any funds."
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": "00:16:22.950",
      "end": "00:16:26.430",
      "text": "Opening up, I guess looking for a moverner speaker,"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": "00:16:26.430",
      "end": "00:16:28.210",
      "text": "a moverner speaker, a moverner and a seconder"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": "00:16:28.210",
      "end": "00:16:29.440",
      "text": "and then I'll do speakers."
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": "00:16:29.440",
      "end": "00:16:30.670",
      "text": "Moved by Councillor Ferreira,"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": "00:16:30.670",
      "end": "00:16:32.490",
      "text": "count seconded by Councillor Pribble,"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": "00:16:32.490",
      "end": "00:16:34.110",
      "text": "starting a speakers list of anyone"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": "00:16:34.110",
      "end": "00:16:36.840",
      "text": "who would like to make comments."
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": "00:16:36.840",
      "end": "00:16:38.890",
      "text": "Councillor Ferreira."
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": "00:16:38.890",
      "end": "00:16:40.160",
      "text": "Thank you and through you."
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": "00:16:40.160",
      "end": "00:16:43.240",
      "text": "Two, I guess Ms. Smith and your team,"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": "00:16:43.240",
      "end": "00:16:45.660",
      "text": "I was wondering if you could expand on some of the initiatives"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": "00:16:45.660",
      "end": "00:16:48.050",
      "text": "that the building saver communities fund"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "start": "00:16:48.050",
      "end": "00:16:51.610",
      "text": "would move along."
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "start": "00:16:51.610",
      "end": "00:16:54.790",
      "text": "Ms. Smith and team."
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "start": "00:16:54.790",
      "end": "00:16:56.220",
      "text": "Sure, thank you and through the chair."
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "start": "00:16:56.220",
      "end": "00:16:58.200",
      "text": "So I'm gonna have the staff enter,"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "start": "00:16:58.200",
      "end": "00:17:02.080",
      "text": "give you a few more details on this and an overview."
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "start": "00:17:02.080",
      "end": "00:17:05.800",
      "text": "As you know, this is a grant of funding agreement."
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "start": "00:17:05.800",
      "end": "00:17:07.040",
      "text": "So the purpose of this,"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "start": "00:17:07.040",
      "end": "00:17:08.830",
      "text": "we went out and did a community engagement"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "start": "00:17:08.830",
      "end": "00:17:11.260",
      "text": "in a need assessment to hear the priorities."
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "start": "00:17:11.260",
      "end": "00:17:12.860",
      "text": "We then had to align the priorities"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "start": "00:17:12.860",
      "end": "00:17:15.650",
      "text": "with the overall outcomes of the federal program."
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "start": "00:17:15.650",
      "end": "00:17:19.070",
      "text": "And then what we did through intense engagement"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "start": "00:17:19.070",
      "end": "00:17:22.220",
      "text": "is understand what are the priorities right now in London"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "start": "00:17:22.220",
      "end": "00:17:24.890",
      "text": "that align with the purpose of this fund."
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "start": "00:17:24.890",
      "end": "00:17:28.320",
      "text": "And so we will then go out through a grant"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "start": "00:17:28.320",
      "end": "00:17:31.590",
      "text": "and application process and seek organizations"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "start": "00:17:31.590",
      "end": "00:17:34.400",
      "text": "to implement projects and programs"
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "start": "00:17:34.400",
      "end": "00:17:36.890",
      "text": "that align with the grant priorities."
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "start": "00:17:36.890",
      "end": "00:17:39.060",
      "text": "So I'll turn it over to Ms. Pollack"
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "start": "00:17:39.060",
      "end": "00:17:42.280",
      "text": "to explain some of those priorities."
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "start": "00:17:42.280",
      "end": "00:17:44.190",
      "text": "Thank you and through the chair."
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "start": "00:17:44.190",
      "end": "00:17:47.190",
      "text": "So there's two key activities that are included"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "start": "00:17:47.190",
      "end": "00:17:48.620",
      "text": "within the submission."
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "start": "00:17:48.620",
      "end": "00:17:50.740",
      "text": "One is a grant program."
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "start": "00:17:50.740",
      "end": "00:17:52.300",
      "text": "So the purpose of this grant program"
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "start": "00:17:52.300",
      "end": "00:17:55.730",
      "text": "is to get the funding into the community where it's needed."
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "start": "00:17:55.730",
      "end": "00:17:58.400",
      "text": "And so as Ms. Smith mentioned,"
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "start": "00:17:58.400",
      "end": "00:18:01.400",
      "text": "we will be doing a full call for proposals"
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "start": "00:18:01.400",
      "end": "00:18:04.070",
      "text": "based off of the engagement that we've already undertaken."
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "start": "00:18:04.070",
      "end": "00:18:07.430",
      "text": "And in addition, given that this is one time funding,"
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "start": "00:18:07.430",
      "end": "00:18:09.380",
      "text": "there's another activity that we submitted"
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "start": "00:18:09.380",
      "end": "00:18:13.610",
      "text": "related to training, coaching, and capacity building."
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "start": "00:18:13.610",
      "end": "00:18:18.170",
      "text": "So this funding will go directly to the organizations"
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "start": "00:18:18.170",
      "end": "00:18:21.600",
      "text": "that are on receipt of funding for support with evaluation,"
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "start": "00:18:21.600",
      "end": "00:18:25.310",
      "text": "for support with anti-racism and anti-oppression training"
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "start": "00:18:25.310",
      "end": "00:18:28.310",
      "text": "as well as help with implementing programs."
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "start": "00:18:28.310",
      "end": "00:18:31.620",
      "text": "So the purpose here is to help build some sustainability"
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "start": "00:18:31.620",
      "end": "00:18:33.700",
      "text": "and capacity within the community."
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "start": "00:18:33.700",
      "end": "00:18:35.710",
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "start": "00:18:35.710",
      "end": "00:18:37.900",
      "text": "Councilor Perreira, follow up?"
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "start": "00:18:37.900",
      "end": "00:18:38.680",
      "text": "Now through you."
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "start": "00:18:38.680",
      "end": "00:18:40.130",
      "text": "Thank you for that, that's all."
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "start": "00:18:40.130",
      "end": "00:18:43.390",
      "text": "Thank you, Councilor Perreira."
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "start": "00:18:43.390",
      "end": "00:18:44.940",
      "text": "Good morning, through the chair to the staff."
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "start": "00:18:44.940",
      "end": "00:18:46.140",
      "text": "I do have a few questions."
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "start": "00:18:46.140",
      "end": "00:18:48.400",
      "text": "If you can go up, please, to page 15."
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "start": "00:18:48.400",
      "end": "00:18:51.540",
      "text": "I mean, that's eligible expenses for fiscal year."
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "start": "00:18:51.540",
      "end": "00:18:54.720",
      "text": "The expenses categories, was that done by us,"
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "start": "00:18:54.720",
      "end": "00:18:59.190",
      "text": "or was that given to us by Public Safety Canada?"
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "start": "00:18:59.190",
      "end": "00:19:00.600",
      "text": "To staff."
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "start": "00:19:00.600",
      "end": "00:19:02.720",
      "text": "Thank you, and through you, Chair, that's a good question."
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "start": "00:19:02.720",
      "end": "00:19:05.700",
      "text": "These are Public Safety Canada funding lines"
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "start": "00:19:05.700",
      "end": "00:19:10.480",
      "text": "that we had to fill in the amounts for."
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "start": "00:19:10.480",
      "end": "00:19:12.290",
      "text": "Councilor Perreira?"
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "start": "00:19:12.290",
      "end": "00:19:13.940",
      "text": "Categories then are by Canada,"
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "start": "00:19:13.940",
      "end": "00:19:21.050",
      "text": "and us, we did include the amounts there, how do you think?"
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "start": "00:19:21.050",
      "end": "00:19:21.890",
      "text": "Staff."
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "start": "00:19:21.890",
      "end": "00:19:22.720",
      "text": "Through the chair, that is correct."
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "start": "00:19:22.720",
      "end": "00:19:24.390",
      "text": "These are their expense categories."
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "start": "00:19:24.390",
      "end": "00:19:26.490",
      "text": "We don't have any flexibility on those,"
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "start": "00:19:26.490",
      "end": "00:19:30.550",
      "text": "and then we had to estimate our, what percentages"
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "start": "00:19:30.550",
      "end": "00:19:32.850",
      "text": "of our overall allotment for each year"
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "start": "00:19:32.850",
      "end": "00:19:36.200",
      "text": "would be in each of those categories."
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "start": "00:19:36.200",
      "end": "00:19:37.130",
      "text": "Councilor?"
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "start": "00:19:37.130",
      "end": "00:19:40.120",
      "text": "So now when the grants are gonna come in,"
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "start": "00:19:40.120",
      "end": "00:19:42.430",
      "text": "how about if they don't fit into these categories?"
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "start": "00:19:42.430",
      "end": "00:19:44.140",
      "text": "Do we have a room to shuffle it around?"
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "start": "00:19:44.140",
      "end": "00:19:47.600",
      "text": "Because I, for example, saw the consulting 100,000, 100,000,"
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "start": "00:19:47.600",
      "end": "00:19:49.700",
      "text": "50,000, which again, I would think"
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "start": "00:19:49.700",
      "end": "00:19:52.410",
      "text": "that certainly may be for the first year,"
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "start": "00:19:52.410",
      "end": "00:19:55.590",
      "text": "but for second year and third year consulting in these,"
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "start": "00:19:55.590",
      "end": "00:19:58.910",
      "text": "so do we have a flexibility, and can we adjust it"
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "start": "00:19:58.910",
      "end": "00:20:01.700",
      "text": "as the grants come in?"
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "start": "00:20:01.700",
      "end": "00:20:04.000",
      "text": "Ms. Smith and team."
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "start": "00:20:04.000",
      "end": "00:20:05.390",
      "text": "Thank you for the question and through the chair."
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "start": "00:20:05.390",
      "end": "00:20:07.450",
      "text": "Yes, there is some room to amend."
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "start": "00:20:07.450",
      "end": "00:20:10.980",
      "text": "Less than 20%, we're able to do an administrative amendment"
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "start": "00:20:10.980",
      "end": "00:20:12.490",
      "text": "with Public Safety Canada."
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "start": "00:20:12.490",
      "end": "00:20:15.150",
      "text": "Otherwise, we can do a full amended agreement"
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "start": "00:20:15.150",
      "end": "00:20:18.300",
      "text": "if necessary, thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "start": "00:20:18.300",
      "end": "00:20:19.570",
      "text": "Councilor Preble, follow up?"
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "start": "00:20:19.570",
      "end": "00:20:21.790",
      "text": "Okay, thank you for that, yes, I do,"
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "start": "00:20:21.790",
      "end": "00:20:26.100",
      "text": "and when I look at page six, the proposal,"
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "start": "00:20:26.100",
      "end": "00:20:30.070",
      "text": "grants will become a bill start September 23rd,"
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "start": "00:20:30.070",
      "end": "00:20:34.800",
      "text": "and they are gonna actually start January 24th,"
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "start": "00:20:34.800",
      "end": "00:20:37.340",
      "text": "sorry, January 2024."
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "start": "00:20:37.340",
      "end": "00:20:40.930",
      "text": "And if I look at the first allotment of the $1 million,"
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "start": "00:20:40.930",
      "end": "00:20:45.360",
      "text": "it's until March 24th, which will give us,"
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "start": "00:20:45.360",
      "end": "00:20:47.260",
      "text": "it gives us only three months."
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "start": "00:20:47.260",
      "end": "00:20:49.830",
      "text": "Are we obligated to spend the million dollars"
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "start": "00:20:49.830",
      "end": "00:20:56.260",
      "text": "in the first three months, or can we carry it on over?"
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "start": "00:20:56.260",
      "end": "00:20:57.810",
      "text": "Thank you, and through the chair,"
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "start": "00:20:57.810",
      "end": "00:21:01.150",
      "text": "that deadline is for us to allocate funds to the community,"
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "start": "00:21:01.150",
      "end": "00:21:03.580",
      "text": "not specifically for the community to spend,"
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "start": "00:21:03.580",
      "end": "00:21:06.000",
      "text": "so as long as those funds are allocated"
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "start": "00:21:06.000",
      "end": "00:21:08.860",
      "text": "from the city of London to the community organizations,"
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "start": "00:21:08.860",
      "end": "00:21:13.250",
      "text": "it's considered spent to the federal government."
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "start": "00:21:13.250",
      "end": "00:21:14.200",
      "text": "Perfect, thank you very much,"
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "start": "00:21:14.200",
      "end": "00:21:16.280",
      "text": "and last question on page 10."
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "start": "00:21:16.280",
      "end": "00:21:21.520",
      "text": "It says 5.2 for fiscal year, 2223, it was 309,000."
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "start": "00:21:21.520",
      "end": "00:21:24.650",
      "text": "Did we take advantage of it?"
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "start": "00:21:24.650",
      "end": "00:21:27.670",
      "text": "Did we allocate that amount?"
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "start": "00:21:27.670",
      "end": "00:21:31.810",
      "text": "Ms. Poplak, thank you, and through the chair, yes,"
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "start": "00:21:31.810",
      "end": "00:21:34.780",
      "text": "we were able to allocate almost all of that funding,"
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "start": "00:21:34.780",
      "end": "00:21:39.740",
      "text": "we allocated roughly $277,000, there was a $30,000 variance."
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "start": "00:21:39.740",
      "end": "00:21:44.100",
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "start": "00:21:44.100",
      "end": "00:21:46.200",
      "text": "Follow up, Councilor Preble?"
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "start": "00:21:46.200",
      "end": "00:21:47.120",
      "text": "No more follow up questions,"
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "start": "00:21:47.120",
      "end": "00:21:49.490",
      "text": "thank you very much for all the answers."
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "start": "00:21:49.490",
      "end": "00:21:51.110",
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "start": "00:21:51.110",
      "end": "00:21:54.390",
      "text": "Looking online to see if Councilor Stevenson"
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "start": "00:21:54.390",
      "end": "00:21:56.410",
      "text": "or Councilor Ramen would like to make comment,"
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "start": "00:21:56.410",
      "end": "00:22:03.200",
      "text": "as I have exhausted my speaker's list within chambers."
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "start": "00:22:03.200",
      "end": "00:22:07.120",
      "text": "Okay, seeing none, it's been moved and seconded,"
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "start": "00:22:07.120",
      "end": "00:22:08.770",
      "text": "speakers list has concluded,"
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "start": "00:22:08.770",
      "end": "00:22:18.820",
      "text": "calling the question in e-scrap."
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "start": "00:22:18.820",
      "end": "00:22:27.090",
      "text": "I will vote yes."
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "start": "00:22:27.090",
      "end": "00:22:30.850",
      "text": "Seeing the vote, the motion carries, five to zero."
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "start": "00:22:30.850",
      "end": "00:22:32.390",
      "text": "Thank you, looking to committee to see if there's any"
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "start": "00:22:32.390",
      "end": "00:22:34.990",
      "text": "deferred matters or additional business,"
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "start": "00:22:34.990",
      "end": "00:22:37.940",
      "text": "as I've not been made aware of, any."
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "start": "00:22:37.940",
      "end": "00:22:40.140",
      "text": "Seeing none from chambers, nothing online,"
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "start": "00:22:40.140",
      "end": "00:22:41.270",
      "text": "that moves us to adjournment,"
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "start": "00:22:41.270",
      "end": "00:22:43.690",
      "text": "so looking for a motion to adjourn."
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "start": "00:22:43.690",
      "end": "00:22:48.260",
      "text": "Moved by Councilor Preble, seconded by Councilor Ferreira."
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "start": "00:22:48.260",
      "end": "00:22:50.710",
      "text": "A hand vote or a verbal vote of all those"
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "start": "00:22:50.710",
      "end": "00:22:53.440",
      "text": "in favor of adjournment."
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "start": "00:22:53.440",
      "end": "00:22:58.170",
      "text": "I vote yes, motion carries."
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "start": "00:22:58.170",
      "end": "00:23:00.370",
      "text": "Thank you again to staff and committee"
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "start": "00:23:00.370",
      "end": "00:23:02.290",
      "text": "for making this special meeting possible"
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "start": "00:23:02.290",
      "end": "00:23:03.690",
      "text": "to meet government deadlines,"
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "start": "00:23:03.690",
      "end": "00:23:04.930",
      "text": "and I wish you all a wonderful day."
    }
  ],
  "transcript_source": "lillian_skinner_archive",
  "transcript_source_url": "https://london.lillianskinner.ca/Meetings/Community%20and%20Protective%20Services%20Committee/2023/06-22/.transcript.srt"
}